# What `docker build` may read. The images need the configurator, the shared config checks in
# scripts/, docker/, and the files the page carries as its starter copy (config.json, ahk/,
# powershell/, img/). Everything personal or bulky stays out of the build.

# Your own layout, commands and notes: never in an image.
local/
.env*
.git/
.vscode/
.claude/
.superpowers/

# Dependencies and outputs are made inside the build.
**/node_modules/
configurator/dist/
configurator/dist-electron/
configurator/release/
configurator/.vitest/
coverage/
results/
.scannerwork/

# Not part of the web page.
**/tests/
qmk/
ci/
docs/
